<title>UK: CRICKET - AUSTRALIA-GLAMORGAN 109-1 IN 2ND INNINGS V AUSTRALIA - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET - AUSTRALIA-GLAMORGAN 109-1 IN 2ND INNINGS V AUSTRALIA - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glamorgan, set 333 for victory, were 109 for one at tea on the final day of the three-day tour match against Australia on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 369-4 declared and 217-7 declared. Glamorgan 254 and 109-1.</p>
